2,"From jazz to hip hop, Afro-South Asian music collaborations reflect imagined, more liberatory worlds",https://scroll.in/article/987321/from-jazz-to-hip-hop-afro-south-asian-music-collaborations-reflect-imagined-more-liberatory-worlds,"February 21, 2021 - Davis’ experimental sound on the album was his attempt to make music for “the Black Power generation.” If this was his political impetus and expression of solidarity with disenfranchised Black youth, that he achieved it by putting Afro-diasporic and South Asian instruments and sounds in conversation with one another is revelatory.",Maay,Afro-Asiatic
