9,The Afro-Asiatic Mashup | Phenderson Djèlí Clark,https://disgruntledharadrim.com/2012/06/03/the-afro-asiatic-mashup/,"February 23, 2014 - I attended an event at the Smithsonian this weekend called Asia After Dark: Afro-Asiatic Mash-Up. Held in the meditative Moongate garden, the evening featured a “mash-up” of Japanese vogue dance, theater, storytelling, hip-hop music and Afro-funk (Fela!) choreographed by visual artist iona rozeal brown.",Maay,Afro-Asiatic
